<urn:atm:triage:finding/AO1-SLEEP-001>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "AO1-SLEEP-001" ;
  triage:title "New fixed-duration sleep in TestPeerConfigStore test helper fails fixed-sleep lint" ;
  triage:description "The AO1-RSH-001 fix commit (bede69ff6) added std::thread::sleep(Duration::from_millis(40)) at crates/peer-tls/src/lib.rs:301, inside test-only helper TestPeerConfigStore::delay_if_requested(). just lint fixed-sleep forbids any fixed-duration sleep, including test-only code, and fails on both ubuntu and windows CI for PR #942. Replace the fixed sleep with the repo existing async/condvar/notify-based test synchronization primitive so the delay is event-driven rather than time-based." ;
